<translate>
==== PoisonPower ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used as a factor for the strength of the poison in an item. Affects the rate of poisoning.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
PoisonPower = 75,
</syntaxhighlight>
